# Testing

Full detail: `docs/plans/IMPLEMENTATION-PHASES.md` (quality gates).

## Every phase gate (from Phase 1+)

1. Typecheck
2. Lint
3. Unit tests
4. Integration tests
5. Production build
6. Manual check of changed pages
7. Report → stop

## Critical e2e scenarios (add when those features exist)

- Admin sign-in
- Create draft
- Edit blocks
- Publish
- Public blocked from draft
- Restore version
- Google Docs import
- Google Sheets import
- Sync conflict handling

## Accessibility checks

Keyboard navigation, focus states, ARIA, contrast, `prefers-reduced-motion`, image alt text, keyboard alternative to drag-and-drop, accessible video player, correct heading order.

## Rules

- Do not skip failing checks; do not weaken types/lint to greenwash.
- Prefer tests that assert domain and security behavior over brittle UI snapshots.
- Phase 0: no app toolchain yet — define commands in docs/scripts; do not invent fake passing suites.
